00:00:16.238 --> 00:00:17.829
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:17.831 --> 00:00:19.752
&gt;&gt; Sandra: FIRST OFF, THE NEW

00:00:19.787 --> 00:00:20.915
STRAIN, WE’RE TALKING TO THE

00:00:20.916 --> 00:00:21.726
AUDIENCE ABOUT IT.

00:00:21.761 --> 00:00:23.509
HOW DEADLY IS IT?

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.896
ARE WE ABLE TO DETECT IT AND IS

00:00:25.897 --> 00:00:27.057
IT GROWING IN NUMBERS?

00:00:27.091 --> 00:00:28.171
&gt;&gt; WHICH ONE ARE YOU TALKING

00:00:28.172 --> 00:00:28.713
ABOUT?

00:00:28.714 --> 00:00:30.228
