00:00:32.137 --> 00:00:33.351
&gt;&gt; Sandra: THAT’S THE PROBLEM.

00:00:33.352 --> 00:00:34.051
WHICH ONE.

00:00:34.052 --> 00:00:35.906
LET START WITH THE U.K., AND

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.169
THEN SOUTH AFRICA.

00:00:37.171 --> 00:00:39.011
WHAT DO WE NEED TO BE WORRIED

00:00:39.012 --> 00:00:39.829
ABOUT AS AMERICANS?

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.347
WHAT IS HERE NOW?

00:00:41.348 --> 00:00:43.749
&gt;&gt; WE NEED TO TAKE IT SERIOUSLY.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.581
THE U.K. STRAIN, WHICH IS ONE

00:00:45.615 --> 00:00:48.530
WITH A CERTAIN SET OF MUTATIONS

00:00:48.564 --> 00:00:50.309
IS ALREADY IN 25 OR MORE STATES

00:00:50.343 --> 00:00:51.744
