00:00:51.745 --> 00:00:53.962
IT HAS BEEN SHOWN ACCORDING TO

00:00:53.996 --> 00:00:56.676
THE WORK THAT WE’RE DOING BY OUR

00:00:56.677 --> 00:01:00.949
COLLEAGUES IN THE U.K. TO BE

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:02.901
MORE TRANSMISSABLE, MORE EASY TO

00:01:02.902 --> 00:01:03.345
TRANSMIT.

00:01:03.346 --> 00:01:07.866
THEY SAID IT WAS NOT MORE LETHAL

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.976
NAMELY IT DIDN’T CAUSE ON A

00:01:09.978 --> 00:01:10.848
PERSON-TO-PERSON BASIS MORE

00:01:10.849 --> 00:01:11.742
SERIOUS DISEASE.

00:01:11.743 --> 00:01:13.952
BUT THEY CAME OUT WITH NEW DATA

00:01:13.953 --> 00:01:15.993
THAT INDICATES THE U.K. STRAIN

00:01:16.027 --> 00:01:18.644
MIGHT IN FACT BE A BIT MORE

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.619
DEADLY THAN WHAT WE CALL THE

00:01:20.653 --> 00:01:21.966
WILD-TYPE STRAIN.

00:01:21.967 --> 00:01:26.954
WITH REGARD TO THE VACCINES,
DOES NOT SEEM TO BE ANY NEGATIVE

00:01:26.988 --> 00:01:31.537
DOES NOT SEEM TO BE ANY NEGATIVE

00:01:31.539 --> 00:01:39.121
IMPACT ON THE U.K. STRAIN.

00:01:39.122 --> 00:01:43.574
THEY’VE BEEN USED FOR TREATMENT

00:01:43.608 --> 00:01:45.201
AND PREVENTION.

00:01:45.235 --> 00:01:48.010
DON’T WORK AS WELL AS THAT

00:01:48.012 --> 00:01:48.920
STRAIN.

00:01:48.955 --> 00:01:51.849
IT IS DIMINISHED SOMEWHAT THE

00:01:51.884 --> 00:01:54.237
CAPABILITY OF THE VACCINE TO

00:01:54.238 --> 00:01:56.930
PROTECT, BUT AND THIS IS AN

00:01:56.931 --> 00:01:58.746
IMPORTANT BUT, THE VACCINE STILL

00:01:58.747 --> 00:02:00.830
IS EFFECTIVE AGAINST THIS STRAIN

00:02:00.865 --> 00:02:02.533
THAT IS IN SOUTH AFRICA.

00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:05.774
HAVING SAID THAT, WE NEED TO TRY

00:02:05.808 --> 00:02:09.291
AND STAY A FEW STEPS AHEAD OF

00:02:09.292 --> 00:02:11.942
THE GAME SO WE ALREADY ARE

00:02:11.976 --> 00:02:15.050
PREPARING IN CASE THAT MUTANT A

00:02:15.085 --> 00:02:16.761
GETS HERE, WHICH IT MIGHT BE

00:02:16.763 --> 00:02:17.520
HERE.

00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:20.402
IN CASE IT GETS DOCUMENTED TO BE

00:02:20.437 --> 00:02:21.308
HERE.

00:02:21.342 --> 00:02:24.532
AND WE NEED TO BE PREPARED TO

00:02:24.566 --> 00:02:27.721
UPGRADE THE VACCINE TO ALLOW IT

00:02:27.756 --> 00:02:30.170
TO BE ABLE TO PROTECT.

00:02:30.171 --> 00:02:33.327
RIGHT NOW THE VACCINES LOOK FINE

00:02:33.362 --> 00:02:35.378
AGAINST BOTH THE U.K. AND THE

00:02:35.412 --> 00:02:36.525
SOUTH AFRICAN STRAIN.

00:02:36.526 --> 00:02:38.323
&gt;&gt; John: DR. FAUCI, YOU SAID IN

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.738
THE LAST COUPLE DAYS WHEN IT

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:41.045
COMES TO THE VACCINE, SUPPLY

00:02:41.047 --> 00:02:42.691
WILL NOT MEET THE DEMAND, WHICH

00:02:42.726 --> 00:02:44.363
IS LANGUAGE THAT IS A LOT

00:02:44.398 --> 00:02:46.051
DIFFERENT THAN WHAT WE SAW JUST

00:02:46.085 --> 00:02:47.595
