00:02:47.596 --> 00:02:48.402
DAYS OF THE TRUMP

00:02:48.436 --> 00:02:48.828
ADMINISTRATION.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.492
YOU WERE PART OF IT BACK THEN.

00:02:51.526 --> 00:02:53.527
I DON’T WANT TO GO BACK AND

00:02:53.561 --> 00:02:54.869
REHASH THE TRUMP ADMINISTRATION.

00:02:54.904 --> 00:02:56.766
