00:03:09.343 --> 00:03:11.474
IF THEY WERE A MESS, YOU WERE

00:03:11.509 --> 00:03:12.588
PART OF THAT TEAM.

00:03:12.622 --> 00:03:13.777
SO WHAT WAS IN PLACE AT THAT

00:03:13.778 --> 00:03:14.223
TIME?

00:03:14.225 --> 00:03:16.186
&gt;&gt; YEAH, WELL, JOHN, I REALLY

00:03:16.221 --> 00:03:17.569
DON’T WANT TO GO BACK AND REHASH

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:18.157
THAT.

00:03:18.159 --> 00:03:20.244
THAT IS NOT PRODUCTIVE.

00:03:20.245 --> 00:03:23.544
ONE OF THE THINGS THAT PART OF

00:03:23.579 --> 00:03:25.690
OPERATION WARP SPEED WAS A PLAN

00:03:25.724 --> 00:03:29.596
TO BE ABLE TO GET VACCINE IN

00:03:29.597 --> 00:03:31.643
WHAT GENERAL PERNATHAT WAS IN

00:03:31.645 --> 00:03:33.723
CHARGE OF THAT, GET IT OUT IN A

00:03:33.756 --> 00:03:35.542
CADENCE OF GETTING THE VACCINE

00:03:35.576 --> 00:03:37.562
OUT, GETTING IT SHIPPED, GETTING

00:03:37.563 --> 00:03:39.435
IT DISTRIBUTED AND GETTING IT IN

00:03:39.469 --> 00:03:40.571
TO THE PLACES WHERE IT WAS

00:03:40.606 --> 00:03:42.699
SUPPOSED TO BE.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:46.203
IN THE BEGINNING, THERE WAS SOME

00:03:46.204 --> 00:03:48.132
MISSTEPS THERE BECAUSE THERE WAS

00:03:48.134 --> 00:03:49.778
A DISCREPANCY ABOUT WHAT WAS

00:03:49.779 --> 00:03:51.149
GOING OUT AND WHAT WAS GETTING

00:03:51.183 --> 00:03:53.176
INTO PEOPLE’S ARMS.

00:03:53.177 --> 00:03:56.194
SO RIGHT NOW WHAT WE’RE TRYING

00:03:56.195 --> 00:03:59.776
TO DO IS TO GET A BROADER PLAN.

00:03:59.811 --> 00:04:01.910
A LOT OF GOOD THINGS DID HAPPEN

00:04:01.912 --> 00:04:03.491
WITH OPERATION WARP SPEED.

00:04:03.493 --> 00:04:06.128
LET’S LOOK FORWARD ABOUT WHAT

00:04:06.129 --> 00:04:10.018
THE PRESIDENT, PRESIDENT BIDEN,

00:04:10.019 --> 00:04:13.355
HAS SAID, HOW WE’RE GOING TO GET

00:04:13.356 --> 00:04:15.443
AS MANY DOSES IN AS MANY PEOPLE

00:04:15.445 --> 00:04:16.318
AS WE CAN.

00:04:16.319 --> 00:04:18.236
THAT’S WHY WE HAVE HIS PLAN.

00:04:18.237 --> 00:04:20.421
I WANT TO EMPHASIZE, IT’S A

00:04:20.423 --> 00:04:22.178
FLAW, NOT A CEILING TO GET 100

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.462
MILLION DOSES IN TO PEOPLE IN

00:04:24.496 --> 00:04:26.142
THE FIRST 100 DAYS.

00:04:26.176 --> 00:04:28.017
&gt;&gt; Sandra: DR. FAUCI, ON THAT

00:04:28.018 --> 00:04:30.211
NOTE, IT BOGGLES MANY WHEN YOU

00:04:30.246 --> 00:04:32.686
SEE THE DECISIONS THAT GOVERNORS

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:33.976
