00:05:04.747 --> 00:05:07.179
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I HAVE TO TELL YOU,

00:05:07.214 --> 00:05:09.840
I’M NOT GOING TO BE OUT HERE

00:05:09.874 --> 00:05:12.309
OUTGETTING A GOVERNOR WHO IS ON

00:05:12.344 --> 00:05:13.953
THE GROUND IN HIS OR HER OWN

00:05:13.954 --> 00:05:14.482
STATE --

00:05:14.516 --> 00:05:15.484
&gt;&gt; Sandra: THOSE ARE HIS

00:05:15.485 --> 00:05:16.266
STATISTICS.

00:05:16.301 --> 00:05:18.492
&gt;&gt; WE’RE NOT GOING THERE.

00:05:18.493 --> 00:05:19.772
I’M NOT OUT GUESSING --

00:05:19.773 --> 00:05:20.842
&gt;&gt; Sandra: TYPE.

00:05:20.844 --> 00:05:22.722
SO YOU DON’T WANT TO GO THERE.

00:05:22.723 --> 00:05:24.237
WHAT ABOUT SCHOOL CLOSURES?

00:05:24.238 --> 00:05:25.173
CHICAGO WON’T REOPEN THEIR

00:05:25.208 --> 00:05:25.545
SCHOOLS.

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:27.559
YOU TALKED ABOUT KIDS ARE NOT

00:05:27.593 --> 00:05:29.076
PASSING THE DISEASE IN THE

00:05:29.111 --> 00:05:30.615
CLASSROOMS WHEN THEY’RE

00:05:30.616 --> 00:05:32.190
FOLLOWING CDC GUIDELINES.

00:05:32.191 --> 00:05:33.867
SHOULDN’T THEY REOPEN SCHOOLS IN

00:05:33.868 --> 00:05:34.697
CHICAGO, FOR EXAMPLE?

00:05:34.732 --> 00:05:37.825
&gt;&gt; WHAT I’M GOING TO TELL YOU

00:05:37.859 --> 00:05:40.896
ARE THE GENERAL PRINCIPLES AND

00:05:40.897 --> 00:05:42.732
EACH INDIVIDUAL STATE, WITH

00:05:42.733 --> 00:05:46.033
THEIR GOVERNOR, CITY WITH THEIR

00:05:46.034 --> 00:05:47.834
MAYOR WILL MAKE THEIR OWN

00:05:47.868 --> 00:05:48.508
DECISIONS.

00:05:48.509 --> 00:05:50.099
LET ME FINISH.

00:05:50.133 --> 00:05:52.426
LET ME COMMENT, SEE IF I CAN

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:55.197
HELP YOU OUT TO UNDERSTAND THE

00:05:55.231 --> 00:05:56.191
BIGGER PICTURE.

00:05:56.193 --> 00:05:58.127
YES, I UNDERSTAND GREATLY THE

00:05:58.128 --> 00:05:59.891
STRAIN THAT IS ON LOCAL

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:01.064
BUSINESSES AND RESTAURANTS AND

00:06:01.066 --> 00:06:02.542
OTHERS, THAT THAT’S THE REASON

00:06:02.543 --> 00:06:04.832
WHY WE NEED HELP.

00:06:04.833 --> 00:06:08.349
WE NEED TO BE ABLE TO GET

00:06:08.351 --> 00:06:10.394
RESOURCES THAT IF INDOOR DINING

00:06:10.429 --> 00:06:13.058
IS GOING TO BE PROHIBITED, WE

00:06:13.092 --> 00:06:15.185
HAVE TO HAVE HELP TO THE OWNERS

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.661
OF THOSE ORGANIZATIONS SO THEY

00:06:16.663 --> 00:06:19.521
DON’T GO UNDER DURING A PERIOD

00:06:19.522 --> 00:06:21.542
OF TIME WHEN WE’RE TRYING TO

00:06:21.543 --> 00:06:22.808
CORRECT AND GET OUR ARMS AND

00:06:22.843 --> 00:06:24.474
THIS OUTBREAK.

00:06:24.475 --> 00:06:26.854
&gt;&gt; Sandra: WE’RE SUPPOSED TO BE

00:06:26.888 --> 00:06:27.634
FOLLOWING THE SCIENCE.

00:06:27.669 --> 00:06:28.535
THAT’S THE PROBLEM.

00:06:28.537 --> 00:06:30.051
SCIENCE SAYS THAT KIDS CAN

00:06:30.052 --> 00:06:33.186
SAFELY BE BACK IN THE CLASSROOM

00:06:33.187 --> 00:06:34.407
IF THEY’RE FOLLOWING CDC

00:06:34.442 --> 00:06:34.880
GUIDANCE?

00:06:34.914 --> 00:06:36.943
&gt;&gt; WHAT THE SCIENCE TELLS US IS

00:06:36.945 --> 00:06:37.654
THE FOLLOWING.

00:06:37.688 --> 00:06:39.398
CHILDREN IN SCHOOL RIGHT NOW IT

00:06:39.399 --> 00:06:42.322
APPEARS THAT IF YOU FOLLOW THE

00:06:42.356 --> 00:06:44.818
SAFETY GUIDELINES OF THE CDC,

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:46.938
THAT THEY ARE LESS LIKELY TO BE

00:06:46.939 --> 00:06:48.821
GETTING INFECTED THAN THE

00:06:48.856 --> 00:06:50.456
COMMUNITY RATE OF INFECTION.

00:06:50.457 --> 00:06:53.087
THAT IS THE REASON WHY AS

00:06:53.089 --> 00:06:54.494
PRESIDENT BIDEN HAS SAID, WE’RE

00:06:54.528 --> 00:06:56.757
GOING TO TRY AS BEST AS WE CAN

00:06:56.758 --> 00:06:59.112
WITHIN THE FRAME WORK OF

00:06:59.114 --> 00:07:00.965
FOLLOWING THE CDC GUIDELINES TO

00:07:00.967 --> 00:07:02.670
GET CHILDREN BACK TO SCHOOL.

00:07:02.672 --> 00:07:04.143
I’VE BEEN SAYING THAT FOR MONTHS

00:07:04.178 --> 00:07:05.130
AND MONTHS.

00:07:05.164 --> 00:07:07.406
THAT THE DEFAULT POSITION SHOULD

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:11.186
BE TO THE BEST OF OUR ABILITY

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.397
PROVIDE THE RESOURCES TO THE

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:16.182
LOCAL AREAS SO THAT CHILDREN CAN

00:07:16.183 --> 00:07:19.103
GET BACK TO SCHOOL PROVIDED THEY

00:07:19.105 --> 00:07:20.955
HAVE FUNDAMENTAL SAFETY MEASURES

00:07:20.956 --> 00:07:23.165
LIKE MASK WEARING AND THINGS

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.140
LIKE THAT.

00:07:24.141 --> 00:07:26.650
THAT MAY REQUIRE ADDITIONAL

00:07:26.651 --> 00:07:28.500
RESOURCES TO THE LOCAL SCHOOL

00:07:28.535 --> 00:07:29.349
DISTRICTS.

00:07:29.351 --> 00:07:33.578
&gt;&gt; John: THE DEFAULT POSITION,

00:07:33.579 --> 00:07:35.922
DR. FAUCI, OF THE TEACHERS

00:07:35.923 --> 00:07:37.918
UNIONS WE’RE NOT GOING BACK

00:07:37.952 --> 00:07:39.081
UNTIL THERE’S GUARANTEED SAFETY.

00:07:39.116 --> 00:07:40.651
THAT DISCUSSION DOESN’T FALL

00:07:40.686 --> 00:07:42.787
INTO YOUR AREA OF PURVIEW.

00:07:42.821 --> 00:07:45.232
BUT WHAT DOES, IS THE W.H.O.,

00:07:45.233 --> 00:07:46.384
THE WORLD HEALTH ORGANIZATION,

00:07:46.385 --> 00:07:47.981
YOU ADDRESSED THEM LAST WEEK.

00:07:47.982 --> 00:07:50.323
YOU SAID THE UNITED STATES WAS

00:07:50.324 --> 00:07:51.566
REENTERING THE W.H.O.

00:07:51.567 --> 00:07:53.245
YOU HAVE ALSO SAID THAT THE

00:07:53.246 --> 00:07:54.630
UNITED STATES IS GOING TO

00:07:54.631 --> 00:07:55.527
PARTICIPATE IN THE

00:07:55.561 --> 00:07:56.523
VACCINE-SHARING PROGRAM WITH THE

00:07:56.524 --> 00:07:56.987
W.H.O.

00:07:57.021 --> 00:07:58.832
SO A COUPLE QUESTIONS.

00:07:58.833 --> 00:08:02.137
FIRST OF ALL, WHEN IT COMES TO

00:08:02.139 --> 00:08:04.301
THE W.H.O., ARE YOU CERTAIN THAT

00:08:04.302 --> 00:08:06.600
THEY’RE OPERATING AS AN

00:08:06.635 --> 00:08:08.554
INDEPENDENT BODY AND NOT ON

00:08:08.589 --> 00:08:10.268
BEHALF OF CHINA AS ALLEGED BY

00:08:10.269 --> 00:08:11.587
THE LAST ADMINISTRATION AND

00:08:11.621 --> 00:08:12.928
SECONDLY, ENTERING THE VACCINE

00:08:12.962 --> 00:08:14.144
SHARING PROGRAM, WHAT EFFECT

00:08:14.146 --> 00:08:16.905
WILL THAT HAVE ON THE UNITED

00:08:16.939 --> 00:08:19.384
STATES’ ABILITY TO GET VACCINES

00:08:19.385 --> 00:08:21.501
OUT TO PEOPLE WHEN WE’RE ALREADY

00:08:21.535 --> 00:08:23.424
HAVING PROBLEMS DOING THAT?

00:08:23.426 --> 00:08:25.782
&gt;&gt; JOHN, THANK YOU FOR POSING

00:08:25.817 --> 00:08:27.802
THE QUESTION IN THAT WAY AND

00:08:27.837 --> 00:08:29.169
HOPEFULLY I’LL GIVE YOU A CLEAR

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:29.589
EXPLANATION.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.852
IF YOU LISTENED, WHICH I THINK

00:08:31.853 --> 00:08:34.052
YOU DID BUT NOT EVERYBODY HAD

00:08:34.053 --> 00:08:34.924
THE OPPORTUNITY TO CAREFULLY

00:08:34.925 --> 00:08:38.237
LOOK AT THE WORDS WHEN I MADE

00:08:38.238 --> 00:08:41.402
THE ANNOUNCEMENT THAT WE WILL BE

00:08:41.403 --> 00:08:43.074
REJOINING THE WHO.

00:08:43.109 --> 00:08:45.445
AT LEAST TWICE DURING THAT

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:48.960
ANNOUNCEMENT, I MADE IT VERY

00:08:48.962 --> 00:08:51.909
CLEAR THAT WE WOULD EXPECT

00:08:51.943 --> 00:08:54.392
REFORMS IN WHO.

00:08:54.426 --> 00:08:57.056
WE WOULD TAKE THE REFORMS VERY

00:08:57.057 --> 00:08:57.397
SERIOUSLY.

00:08:57.432 --> 00:08:59.531
NEXT WE SAID WE WERE VERY MUCH

00:08:59.565 --> 00:09:02.470
IN FAVOR OF THE INVESTIGATION OF

00:09:02.471 --> 00:09:05.413
THE ORIGINS OF THIS VIRUS.

00:09:05.414 --> 00:09:07.358
SO ALTHOUGH WE WILLINGLY SAID

00:09:07.359 --> 00:09:11.114
THAT WE WANT TO REJOIN THE WHO

00:09:11.115 --> 00:09:12.766
AND BE PART OF THE INTERNATIONAL

00:09:12.767 --> 00:09:14.503
COMMUNITY, WE MADE IT VERY CLEAR

00:09:14.504 --> 00:09:16.163
AND I WAS REPRESENTING THE

00:09:16.165 --> 00:09:17.616
PRESIDENT ON THAT ANNOUNCEMENT,

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:20.640
THAT REFORMS ARE GOING TO BE

00:09:20.674 --> 00:09:23.504
TAKEN VERY SERIOUSLY BY US.

00:09:23.538 --> 00:09:25.625
SO THAT ANSWERS YOUR FIRST

00:09:25.626 --> 00:09:26.172
QUESTION.

00:09:26.173 --> 00:09:28.051
NOW, I FORGOT YOUR SECOND

00:09:28.053 --> 00:09:28.664
QUESTION.

00:09:28.699 --> 00:09:33.514
&gt;&gt; John: IT WAS ON JOINING THE

00:09:33.515 --> 00:09:35.314
WHO’S VACCINE-SHARING PROGRAM.

00:09:35.315 --> 00:09:37.428
GETTING VACCINES TO AMERICANS,

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:39.722
IF WE JOIN THE VACCINE-SHARING

00:09:39.756 --> 00:09:40.920
PROGRAM, WILL THAT EXACERBATE

00:09:40.954 --> 00:09:42.269
THE PROBLEM?

00:09:42.303 --> 00:09:44.136
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR ASKING THE

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.433
QUESTION.

00:09:45.435 --> 00:09:49.327
WHEN WE SAY WE’RE JOINING COVAC,

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:51.663
WE’RE NOT SAYING WE’RE GIVING

00:09:51.697 --> 00:09:53.122
THEM ALLOCATIONS THAT WERE OUR

00:09:53.123 --> 00:09:54.050
ALLOCATIONS.

00:09:54.052 --> 00:09:57.726
WE SAID WE WOULD PARTICIPATE IN

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.544
MAKING SURE THAT THERE’S SOME

00:09:59.545 --> 00:10:01.053
EQUITY GLOBALLY FOR COUNTRIES

00:10:01.087 --> 00:10:03.233
THAT CAN’T AFFORD IT.

00:10:03.234 --> 00:10:05.238
THERE’S A NUMBER OF WAYS OF

00:10:05.272 --> 00:10:07.049
DOING THAT.

00:10:07.084 --> 00:10:09.527
ONE IS TO PROVIDE FINANCIAL

00:10:09.528 --> 00:10:12.059
RESOURCES TO THE PROGRAM TO

00:10:12.093 --> 00:10:13.737
DEVELOP VACCINES FROM OTHER

00:10:13.739 --> 00:10:15.561
COMPANIES OR EVEN THE COMPANIES

00:10:15.595 --> 00:10:18.856
THAT WE’RE DEALING WITH SO WE’LL

00:10:18.857 --> 00:10:20.912
BE ABLE TO GET VACCINE DOSES TO

00:10:20.914 --> 00:10:21.283
THEM.

00:10:21.317 --> 00:10:23.158
IT DOESN’T MEAN WE’RE GOING TO

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.673
TAKE THE VACCINE DOSES THAT WERE

00:10:24.707 --> 00:10:25.683
ALLOCATED TO US AND GIVE TO

00:10:25.684 --> 00:10:26.506
THEM.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:30.680
THE OTHER THING IS, IF IT TURNS

00:10:30.714 --> 00:10:32.430
OUT THAT IN OUR CONTRACTUAL

00:10:32.464 --> 00:10:34.583
RELATIONSHIP WE OVERSHOOT AND WE

00:10:34.617 --> 00:10:36.588
HAVE EVEN MORE VACCINE THAN WE

00:10:36.589 --> 00:10:37.684
CAN USE, THERE’S ALWAYS THE

00:10:37.718 --> 00:10:38.166
CONSIDERATION --

00:10:38.168 --> 00:10:39.439
&gt;&gt; Sandra: THAT WOULD BE A NICE

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:40.183
PROBLEM TO HAVE.

00:10:40.217 --> 00:10:41.569
&gt;&gt; THAT WOULD BE.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:42.674
BUT THAT IS CONCEIVABLE THAT

00:10:42.708 --> 00:10:43.845
THAT WOULD HAPPEN.

00:10:43.846 --> 00:10:46.117
SO JUST MAKE SURE THAT THE

00:10:46.152 --> 00:10:47.072
AMERICAN PUBLIC DOESN’T

00:10:47.073 --> 00:10:48.414
INTERPRET THAT WE’LL TAKE

00:10:48.415 --> 00:10:50.064
VACCINE THAT WAS READY TO GO TO

00:10:50.065 --> 00:10:51.590
NEW YORK AND CHICAGO AND GIVE IT

00:10:51.624 --> 00:10:53.137
TO SOMEBODY ELSE.

00:10:53.138 --> 00:10:54.613
THAT’S NOT WHAT WE’RE TALKING

00:10:54.647 --> 00:10:54.916
ABOUT.

00:10:54.951 --> 00:10:56.690
&gt;&gt; Sandra: DR. FAUCI, SEEMS LIKE

00:10:56.692 --> 00:10:58.696
THE GOAL POSTS KEEP MOVING.

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:00.551
WE KNOW CALIFORNIA IS HAVING

00:11:00.552 --> 00:11:01.112
PROBLEMS.

00:11:01.113 --> 00:11:02.373
WE’RE TALKING ABOUT ADDITIONAL

00:11:02.407 --> 00:11:02.852
STRAINS.

00:11:02.886 --> 00:11:05.813
ALL OF US ARE TRYING TO DO WHAT

00:11:05.848 --> 00:11:07.948
IT TAKES TO STAY SAFE.

00:11:07.949 --> 00:11:10.407
WE ALL WEAR OUR MASKS AND HOPE

00:11:10.442 --> 00:11:12.329
THAT MOST PEOPLE ARE.

00:11:12.331 --> 00:11:13.883
NOW WE’RE HEARING WE SHOULD WEAR

00:11:13.884 --> 00:11:14.249
TWO.

00:11:14.284 --> 00:11:17.828
IF I GO TO THE GROCERY STORE, DO

00:11:17.863 --> 00:11:19.894
I WEAR TWO OR THREE OR SAFER TO

00:11:19.929 --> 00:11:20.557
WEAR EIGHTH?

00:11:20.591 --> 00:11:21.963
WHERE DOES IT STOP?

00:11:21.965 --> 00:11:23.807
&gt;&gt; THE DISCUSSION IS CHANGING,

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:26.814
NOT THE GOAL POSTS.

00:11:26.849 --> 00:11:29.716
SO THE CDC DOESN’T OFFICIALLY

00:11:29.717 --> 00:11:31.801
RECOMMEND WEARING DOUBLE MASKS.

00:11:31.803 --> 00:11:34.235
WHAT THEY’RE SAYING IS YOU KNOW

00:11:34.269 --> 00:11:36.592
WHAT WOULD BE A GOOD START?

00:11:36.593 --> 00:11:38.049
IF EVERYBODY WEARS AT LEAST ONE

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:38.447
MASK.

00:11:38.481 --> 00:11:41.229
I THINK THAT WOULD BE IMPORTANT.

00:11:41.231 --> 00:11:42.679
SO THE CDC RECOMMENDATIONS HAVE

00:11:42.713 --> 00:11:43.515
NOT CHANGED.

00:11:43.516 --> 00:11:46.559
WHAT WE’RE TRYING TO DO IS TO

00:11:46.594 --> 00:11:49.364
GET INDIVIDUALS THAT ARE NOT

00:11:49.365 --> 00:11:51.363
WEARING MASKS TO WEAR MASKS.

00:11:51.397 --> 00:11:53.862
&gt;&gt; John: DR. FAUCI, CAN I GET

00:11:53.896 --> 00:11:55.050
ONE QUICK ANSWER TO THE

00:11:55.085 --> 00:11:55.786
FOLLOWING QUESTIONS?

00:11:55.787 --> 00:11:57.678
GOVERNOR CUOMO OF NEW YORK SAID

00:11:57.713 --> 00:11:59.699
TODAY THAT IT’S GOING TO TAKE

00:11:59.701 --> 00:12:01.037
SIX TO NINE MONTHS TO GET

00:12:01.038 --> 00:12:04.134
EVERYBODY VACCINATED OR TO THE

00:12:04.167 --> 00:12:06.251
POINT OFHEAD IMMUNEITY BUT HE

00:12:06.286 --> 00:12:09.237
CAN’T WAIT THAT LONG TO OPEN THE

00:12:09.238 --> 00:12:10.125
ECONOMY BACK UP.

00:12:10.127 --> 00:12:10.939
COMPETING PRESSURES HERE.

00:12:10.974 --> 00:12:13.131
WHAT DO YOU SUGGEST?

00:12:13.165 --> 00:12:17.975
&gt;&gt; YOU DON’T NECESSARILY HAVE TO

00:12:17.976 --> 00:12:21.303
HAVE AN ALL-OR-NONE PHENOMENON.

00:12:21.304 --> 00:12:23.557
I SPEAK WITH GOVERNOR CUOMO

00:12:23.559 --> 00:12:23.822
FREQUENTLY.

00:12:23.857 --> 00:12:25.353
HE’S TRYING TO BALANCE WHAT IS

00:12:25.355 --> 00:12:27.065
BEST FOR THE PUBLIC HEALTH AND

00:12:27.066 --> 00:12:28.587
AT THE SAME TIME ADDRESSING THE

00:12:28.589 --> 00:12:30.315
SERIOUS IMPACT THAT IT WOULD

00:12:30.316 --> 00:12:32.804
HAVE ON THE ECONOMY OF NEW YORK

00:12:32.839 --> 00:12:34.298
STATE AND NEW YORK CITY

00:12:34.299 --> 00:12:35.310
OBVIOUSLY AS AN IMPORTANT PART

00:12:35.345 --> 00:12:37.117
OF NEW YORK STATE.

00:12:37.152 --> 00:12:39.561
WHAT ONE CAN DO IS YOU CAN

00:12:39.595 --> 00:12:41.161
CONTINUE TO HAVE PUBLIC HEALTH

00:12:41.196 --> 00:12:42.315
MEASURES THAT WOULD BE

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:44.726
APPROPRIATE TO THE AMOUNT OF

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:46.612
INFECTION AT THE SAME TIME OF

00:12:46.646 --> 00:12:47.467
GRADUALLY OPENING UP THE

00:12:47.501 --> 00:12:48.536
ECONOMY.

00:12:48.571 --> 00:12:54.947
SO YOU WEARING A MASK, KEEPING

00:12:54.948 --> 00:12:56.567
DISTANCE, AVOIDING CONGREGATE

00:12:56.602 --> 00:12:58.800
SETTINGS, WASHING HANDS, YOU CAN

00:12:58.801 --> 00:13:01.360
HAVE A GREAT IMPACT ON THE

00:13:01.394 --> 00:13:02.691
DYNAMICS OF THE OUTBREAK AND DO

00:13:02.692 --> 00:13:05.017
THAT AT THE SAME TIME THAT

00:13:05.051 --> 00:13:06.184
YOU’RE GRADUALLY OPENING YOUR

00:13:06.186 --> 00:13:06.640
ECONOMY.

00:13:06.674 --> 00:13:08.779
QUITE FRANKLY, JOHN, THAT’S WHAT

00:13:08.781 --> 00:13:10.481
WE SAID MONTHS AND MONTHS AGO

00:13:10.515 --> 00:13:11.962
WHEN WE TRIED TO REOPEN THE

00:13:11.963 --> 00:13:13.941
ECONOMY WITH THE GUIDELINES THAT

00:13:13.942 --> 00:13:15.805
WE PUT OUT.

00:13:15.839 --> 00:13:17.245
UNFORTUNATELY THEY WERE NOT

00:13:17.279 --> 00:13:17.958
UNIFORMLY FOLLOWED.

00:13:17.959 --> 00:13:19.403
&gt;&gt; Sandra: FINAL FINAL.

00:13:19.438 --> 00:13:20.265
REAL QUICK.

00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:21.611
YOU TALKED TO GOVERNOR CUOMO

00:13:21.612 --> 00:13:21.914
OFTEN.

00:13:21.915 --> 00:13:24.610
SO IF HE CALLED YOU TODAY AND

00:13:24.644 --> 00:13:27.498
SAID I HAVE A POSITIVITY RATE

00:13:27.499 --> 00:13:29.575
BELOW 1%, I’VE GOT A LOT OF

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:32.184
PEOPLE VACCINATED, DO YOU THINK

00:13:32.185 --> 00:13:35.040
IT’S SAFE TO REOPEN AT LEAST FOR

00:13:35.041 --> 00:13:36.220
25% CAPACITY IN-PERSON DINING?

00:13:36.221 --> 00:13:37.674
WHAT WOULD YOU TELL HIM?

00:13:37.675 --> 00:13:39.905
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, I WOULD LIKE TO

00:13:39.906 --> 00:13:42.211
HEAR MORE ABOUT WHAT’S GOING ON

00:13:42.246 --> 00:13:43.605
WITH THE DYNAMICS.

00:13:43.606 --> 00:13:45.357
AGAIN, YOU DON’T MAKE POLICY IN

00:13:45.391 --> 00:13:46.944
A CONVERSATION LIKE YOU AND I.

00:13:46.978 --> 00:13:48.975
WHAT I WOULD BE HAPPY TO DO IS

00:13:49.009 --> 00:13:50.651
AFTER I HAVE A CONVERSATION WITH

00:13:50.652 --> 00:13:52.219
THE GOVERNOR, THEN TALK TO YOU

00:13:52.221 --> 00:13:53.729
ABOUT THE THINGS WE DISCUSSED.

00:13:53.763 --> 00:13:55.491
I DON’T WANT TO DO IT BEFORE

00:13:55.525 --> 00:13:56.259
I --

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:58.531
&gt;&gt; Sandra: I APPRECIATE IT.

00:13:58.532 --> 00:13:59.588
THANKS, DR. FAUCI.

00:13:59.622 --> 00:14:00.589
APPRECIATE YOU TAKING THE

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:01.166
QUESTIONS.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.534
&gt;&gt; John: YOU DON’T LAST AS LONG

00:14:03.569 --> 00:14:05.442
AS HE HAS IN HIS POSITION WHEN

